#@extended
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# EXTENDED pool — everything BELOW the "#@extended" marker is a FALLBACK tier.
# Auto-SNI fills every core from the PREFERRED tier above first (proven,
# operator-whitelist-friendly, strong REALITY dests) and only dips into this
# tier when the preferred tier runs out of REALITY-fit hosts. This stops the
# domains that actually cross Iranian ISPs from being displaced by
# lower-latency-but-unwhitelisted ones.
#
# All TLS1.3 + h2. Excludes domains blocked inside Iran and weak REALITY dests
# (exchanges, paywalled news, anti-bot storefronts). The two-phase sweep handles
# a list this size in seconds; paste a top-sites list below to exceed 1000.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

